{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由杜如風主持最新旅遊節目《跟風旅行團》播出後即引爆網絡熱話，有觀眾在社交平台發長文質疑其主持風格如同機械人唸對 …</p><p></p>\n<p>由杜如風主持最新旅遊節目《跟風旅行團》播出後即引爆網絡熱話，有觀眾在社交平台發長文質疑其主持風格如同機械人唸對白。面對連串針對外貌與節目內容尖銳指控，這位作風破格資深女主持火速現身親自寫下五字留言強勢反擊。這種不加修飾直接回應瞬間將整個網絡討論推向白熱化階段。</p>\n<h2>網民發文直指《跟風旅行團》表現生硬猶如AI劇</h2>\n<p>焦點旅遊節目《跟風旅行團》帶領觀眾遠赴首爾探索潮流熱點，不過播出約十五分鐘後便在Threads上引發激烈討論。有網民發文形容杜如風在鏡頭前不斷背誦台詞，完全感受不到對當地景點帶有任何情感，甚至反覆說出「I am a strong woman」如同真人表演AI劇。除了批評對白刺耳與步調過於急促，亦有人將矛頭指向女主持外貌，直指昔日人氣旅遊KOL如今面容變得僵硬猶如木頭人，更有人嫌棄節目介紹景點屬於已經過時資訊。</p>\n<h2>杜如風無懼負評親身以霸氣五字留言強勢反擊</h2>\n<p>面對鋪天蓋地衝擊與質疑聲音，這位被外界封為世界級港女依然保持強大心理質素，毫不退縮地直接在該則批評帖文下方霸氣回覆。她僅以「冇人逼你睇！」五個字作正面反擊，完全展現出其率直且懶理世俗眼光破格真性情。沒有冗長公關辭令或情緒化爭辯，這種乾淨俐落處理方式不但化解尷尬場面，更將其強烈個人特色表露無遺，瞬間成為整個社交平台焦點所在。</p>\n<h2>忠實擁躉細數杜如風十多年來破格獨特主持風格</h2>\n<p>回顧杜如風過去逾十年演藝軌跡，無論是早期《流行東京》還是《流行首爾》，她向來貫徹這種隨性且毫不造作獨有路線。這次爆發討論後，大批陪伴她成長忠實支持者隨即湧入帖文力撐，強調這正是她廿幾年來從未改變過金漆招牌。有擁躉直言欣賞她遇到難吃食物時敢於直說難吃，完全有別於其他旅遊節目主持逢迎買帳那種虛假感，認為她對待旅遊體驗那份直白與坦誠在娛樂圈中絕對是難能可貴。</p>\n<h2>兩極化網絡熱議反證《跟風旅行團》成功引發關注</h2>\n<p>整個網絡評論區目前呈現出極度喜好分明陣營，雖然有部分聲音覺得她與幕後工作人員互動略顯尷尬，甚至認為她對韓國與日本兩地感情無法相提並論，但依然無阻節目話題度直線飆升。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_50200066b066c8341b52.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_50200066b066c8341b52.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339740892616_9508301426b081b55dbcf8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：Threads截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339740892616_9508301426b081b55dbcf8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339896434291_5011947276b081b5752d35.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：Threads截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339896434291_5011947276b081b5752d35.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569340169447676_17024551916b081b5a1f3bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：Threads截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569340169447676_17024551916b081b5a1f3bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14619128846b066c7967890.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14619128846b066c7967890.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501184846169866_70692076afdb508d07fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501184846169866_70692076afdb508d07fe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e7%af%80%e7%9b%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊節目</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">杜如風</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB、Threads截圖資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550717\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.606497+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1335,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:28.835997+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:29.379760+00:00","content_hash":"eedf6b294678be7d289766509880cc01c391af2adc045a69fac008d641d4d3be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}